      "writtenOn": "2019-02-13T19:05:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a good point, but I am reluctant to do that because it will break the Android requirement that changing property one sensor will not affect the other one.\nWhen we increase the ODR of the accel, we also increase the ration, so we will end up throwing few (but not the first one, though).\nWhen we decrease the ODR, we would need to drop the first one only, at most.\n\nSo we may see a glitch on the accelerometer side when changing compass ODR, but only one sample.\n\nAdding a comment.",
